{"voice":"kokoro af_heart","speed":0.92,"pages":{"0":{"title":"Kiyah's Garden of Tiny Clues","text":"","src":"p0.mp3","dur":2.58,"t":[]},"1":{"text":"“My picture will never look right,” Kiyah whispered. Every time she started to draw, the flowers swayed and the butterflies flew away.","src":"p1.mp3","dur":8.68,"t":[[0.08,0.4],[0.4,0.76],[0.76,0.96],[0.96,1.18],[1.18,1.48],[1.48,1.78],[2.24,2.42],[2.42,2.64],[3.52,3.66],[3.66,4.06],[4.06,4.3],[4.3,4.52],[4.52,4.72],[4.72,5.02],[5.38,5.5],[5.5,5.84],[5.84,6.28],[6.28,6.7],[6.7,6.78],[6.78,7.12],[7.12,7.66],[7.66,7.98]]},"2":{"text":"Chike noticed her frown. “What are you creating today?” he asked. “I am trying to draw the garden,” Kiyah said, “but everything keeps moving.”","src":"p2.mp3","dur":9.2,"t":[[0.32,0.66],[0.66,0.9],[0.9,1.2],[1.2,1.42],[2.2,2.26],[2.26,2.36],[2.36,2.46],[2.46,2.76],[2.76,3.2],[3.6,3.72],[3.72,3.92],[4.7,4.82],[4.82,4.94],[4.94,5.14],[5.14,5.32],[5.32,5.5],[5.5,5.64],[5.64,5.94],[6.28,6.52],[6.52,6.8],[6.98,7.32],[7.32,7.64],[7.64,7.98],[7.98,8.52]]},"3":{"text":"“Maybe the garden is giving you clues,” Chike said, holding up his magnifying glass. “Let’s look really, really close.”","src":"p3.mp3","dur":8.35,"t":[[0.28,0.5],[0.5,0.72],[0.72,0.98],[0.98,1.28],[1.28,1.54],[1.54,1.72],[1.72,2.2],[2.68,3],[3,3.44],[3.7,3.92],[3.92,4.16],[4.16,4.32],[4.32,4.94],[4.94,5.28],[6.08,6.44],[6.44,6.58],[6.58,6.84],[6.84,7.28],[7.28,7.72]]},"4":{"text":"They looked closely together: yellow pollen on a bee, tiny holes in a leaf, a spider web shining like silver. Kiyah drew one clue at a time.","src":"p4.mp3","dur":10.1,"t":[[0,0.4],[0.4,0.54],[0.54,0.84],[0.84,1.32],[1.9,2.14],[2.14,2.48],[2.48,2.8],[2.8,2.88],[2.88,3.1],[3.52,3.74],[3.74,4.04],[4.04,4.38],[4.38,4.46],[4.46,4.66],[5.14,5.22],[5.22,5.56],[5.56,5.92],[5.92,6.3],[6.3,6.72],[6.72,7.02],[7.92,8.02],[8.02,8.3],[8.3,8.56],[8.56,8.8],[8.8,9.06],[9.06,9.12],[9.12,9.46]]},"5":{"text":"By evening her page held a bee, a leaf, a ladybug, a web, and bright flowers: the garden she had discovered up close.","src":"p5.mp3","dur":8.38,"t":[[0,0.4],[0.4,0.7],[0.78,1],[1,1.22],[1.22,1.52],[1.52,1.68],[1.68,1.86],[2.24,2.34],[2.34,2.54],[2.94,3.08],[3.08,3.6],[3.88,4.04],[4.04,4.28],[4.28,4.62],[4.62,4.84],[4.84,5.16],[6.1,6.15],[6.12,6.38],[6.38,6.66],[6.66,6.76],[6.76,7.06],[7.06,7.34],[7.34,7.62]]},"7":{"text":"What Kiyah learned “I thought I needed to make it perfect,” Kiyah said. “I just needed to pay attention.”","src":"p7.mp3","dur":7.13,"t":[[0.16,0.46],[0.46,0.74],[0.74,1.14],[1.84,1.92],[1.92,2.16],[2.16,2.32],[2.32,2.52],[2.52,2.72],[2.72,2.86],[2.86,2.98],[2.98,3.46],[3.88,4.12],[4.12,4.38],[4.86,5.04],[5.04,5.24],[5.24,5.48],[5.48,5.72],[5.72,5.88],[5.88,6.36]]},"8":{"text":"3 big takeaways Word to know magnifying glass A magnifying glass is a tool that makes small things look bigger when you look through it. Look Really, Really Close Kiyah could not draw the garden because everything kept moving. When she and Chike looked really close, she found tiny details: yellow pollen on a bee, tiny holes in a leaf and a spider web shining like silver. Draw One Small Thing at a Time Kiyah stopped trying to make it perfect and drew one small thing at a time. By evening her page held a bee, a leaf, a ladybug, a web and bright flowers, the garden she discovered up close. Try it at home: Pick one small thing, like a leaf or a coin, look at it really close (with a magnifying glass if you have one), and draw just the details you notice.","src":"p8.mp3","dur":52.69,"t":[[0,0.24],[0.48,0.76],[0.76,1.34],[1.88,2.12],[2.12,2.3],[2.3,2.5],[3.02,3.6],[3.6,4.04],[4.68,4.9],[4.9,5.44],[5.44,5.9],[5.9,6.2],[6.2,6.3],[6.3,6.58],[6.58,6.86],[6.86,7.04],[7.04,7.34],[7.34,7.72],[7.72,8.1],[8.1,8.38],[8.38,8.68],[8.68,8.8],[8.8,8.96],[8.96,9.18],[9.18,9.4],[9.84,10.1],[10.1,10.48],[10.48,11.18],[11.18,11.54],[12.3,12.58],[12.58,12.74],[12.74,12.96],[12.96,13.22],[13.22,13.4],[13.4,13.64],[13.64,13.98],[13.98,14.38],[14.38,14.74],[14.74,1